    "lore": "Malgrave was the quartermaster of the Ashen Legion, the man who counted the dead after every siege. When the Legion fell at the gates of Velmoragh he kept counting, and the dead began to answer. He rebuilt his army from the ossuaries under the city, one femur at a time, and now marches it back toward the living with ledgers of every debt the world owes his soldiers.",
    "personality": "Dry, meticulous, bureaucratic about death. Speaks of battles as inventories.",
